+config AYANEO_SERIAL_MCU
+	tristate "AYANEO handheld controller MCU serial interface"
+	depends on SERIAL_DEV_BUS
+	depends on OF
+	help
+	  Say Y here to claim the UART that the controller MCU on AYANEO
+	  handhelds is wired to, and to put that MCU into its Xbox 360
+	  personality on boards whose device tree asks for it. Without the
+	  switch the pad enumerates as a direct-input device with no force
+	  feedback, so rumble does not work.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
+	  be called ayaneo-serial-mcu.
+
 source "drivers/misc/lis3lv02d/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/misc/altera-stapl/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/misc/mei/Kconfig"
